{"name": "The Last Camp : Dawn", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Camp is a post-apocalyptic world-themed game. It utilizes high-quality graphics, a rich weapon and item system, and a vast world map to create a cross-generational twin-stick shooter, bringing a feast to hardcore shooter players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/b9304927f615d1e75db6ef6bdf3db891.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world has become a wasteland, and humanity has established its last camp on the ruins. Everyone must coexist with the post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The camp will encounter various problems, such as a lack of oil, inability to generate electricity, and the need for clean water. Players must solve these crises as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/1c35d0d920524d230640275762ec3d1d.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, players must use the technology and weapons left behind by humanity to fight against various mutated zombies, evil raiders, and giant mechanical monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/61acdef0cb998934d4cc0154b3b756ba.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/61acdef0cb998934d4cc0154b3b756ba.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/61acdef0cb998934d4cc0154b3b756ba.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes 8 chapters and endless side challenge levels, with a total playtime of over 15 hours. A full pathfinding system is included throughout the main storyline, ensuring you'll never get lost on the game map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.poster.avif?t=1785055381\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.webm?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/extras/e62abd5ec7f83eea997c5c88fd562f1b.mp4?t=1785055381\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can play solo or online in co-op (up to 4 players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The initial release includes two free DLC items: the Explorer Weapon Pack and the Conqueror Kit.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "The Last Camp is a post-apocalyptic world-themed game. It utilizes high-quality graphics, a rich weapon and item system, and a vast world map to create a cross-generational twin-stick shooter, bringing a feast to hardcore shooter players.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198430/931fc4d1cc3e1e8aca453a0179b76f903afb18dc/header.jpg?t=1785055381", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Action", "Action-Adventure", "Shooter", "3D Platformer", "Top-Down Shooter"], "developers": "Paradow Environment LIMITED, Hangzhou Digital Source Polar Technology Co., Ltd.", "publishers": "Paradow Environment LIMITED, Hangzhou Digital Source Polar Technology Co., Ltd.", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4198430", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/pf7vKz3pwMw", "first_seen": 1777327200.0, "review_rank